          ],
          "retained": [
            "Assign aligned, contiguous column stripes to persistent workers; exchange immutable row boundaries using padded release/acquire progress counters.",
            "Use 32-row synchronization batches and require at least 512 columns per requested worker.",
            "Store obstacles in sorted CSR row slices, sorting with static OpenMP work sharing in the same team.",
            "Use in-place DP with conditional modular subtraction over unblocked runs, O(N) DP/boundary storage, and unsynchronized stream input."
          ]
